A||||4||saleenfiero||Door out of alignment?!?||||1||
Z||000000||saleenfiero||07-20-2001||07:15 PM||||I just noticed my driver's door sort of hitting the fender where they would meet.  Not hard, but they touch and kind of push against each other until both snap back into place.  I'm worried this will eventually take a chunk out of either the door skin or the fender, do I need new bushings or something?||||reg||1
